KET LUAN
======================================================================
Khong crash o buoc nao, derive_time_columns() nhan dung cot, ca 3 tool goi truc tiep deu ok: False
Agent that (LLM) khong hit_max_iterations: True

=== KET LUAN CHINH THUC ===
1. KHONG CRASH: app.py, DatasetManager, ca 8 tool deu chay khong exception nao khi
   nhan CSV schema hoan toan la — dung nhu ky vong cho on-dinh he thong.
2. LOI THAT PHAT HIEN (khong phai crash, la logic gap that su): derive_time_columns()
   KHONG detect duoc cot "ngay_ghi_nhan" (dinh dang DD/MM/YYYY) lam nguon datetime.
   Nguyen nhan: pd.to_datetime(..., errors="coerce") KHONG truyen dayfirst=True — voi
   ngay nhu 15/03/2024 (ngay=15>12, khong the hieu la thang) bi coerce thanh NaT theo
   cach hieu MM/DD mac dinh; cac ngay nhu 01/03/2024 van "parse duoc" nhung SAI NGHIA
   (hieu nham thanh thang 1 ngay 3). Ty le parse "thanh cong" (du sai nghia) tren
   dataset test nay rot xuong duoi nguong 95% -> cot bi tu choi hoan toan.
3. HE QUA: group_metric(group_by="month") va aggregate_metric(start_date/end_date)
   deu that bai voi thong bao loi ro rang (khong phai loi im lang) tren du lieu co
   cot thoi gian dinh dang DD/MM/YYYY.
4. Agent that (LLM qua OpenRouter) KHONG bi anh huong nghiem trong: khong
   hit_max_iterations, tra loi lich su/trung thuc ve gioi han (dung sai ly do — LLM
   noi la do thieu filter theo ma_tram, thuc te goc re la thieu cot thoi gian derive
   duoc — nhung khong crash, khong bia so).
5. RUI RO DEMO: dinh dang ngay DD/MM/YYYY rat pho bien o Viet Nam — neu mentor upload
   CSV voi cot ngay dinh dang nay, moi cau hoi theo thang/khoang ngay se fail dung
   nhu ket qua o tren.

Fix de xuat (CHUA lam trong task nay, ngoai pham vi audit — chi ghi nhan): them
dayfirst=True vao pd.to_datetime() trong derive_time_columns() (tools/dataset_manager.py),
hoac thu ca 2 huong (dayfirst=True/False) roi chon huong co ty le parse cao hon.
